cff-version: 1.2.0
title: msamtools
message: >-
  If you use msamtools, please cite the software using this
  metadata.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Arumugam
    given-names: Mani
    orcid: 'https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0886-9101'
repository-code: 'https://github.com/arumugamlab/msamtools'
url: 'https://github.com/arumugamlab/msamtools'
abstract: >-
  msamtools is a command-line toolkit for filtering and
  profiling SAM/BAM alignments, with functionality tailored
  to metagenomic and metatranscriptomic workflows. It
  supports filtering by alignment identity and aligned
  fraction, best-hit and unique-hit selection, and abundance
  profiling with configurable handling of multi-mapped
  reads, including proportional sharing.
keywords:
  - bioinformatics
  - metagenomics
  - metatranscriptomics
  - sequence alignment
  - SAM
  - BAM
  - alignment filtering
  - abundance profiling
  - multi-mapping
